  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhyrom/beamline/refs/heads/ver/1.20.1/.github/assets/icon.png\" width=\"192\" height=\"192\" alt=\"标志\"><h1>机械动力：光束线路</h1></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-beamline\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-beamline\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/xhyrom/beamline\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fxhyrom\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\"></a></div><p><strong>机械动力：光束线路</strong> 是机械动力模组的扩展，为其显示连接系统引入了多路复用功能。</p><h2>功能是什么？</h2><p>机械动力：光束线路 引入了一种名为 <strong>智能显示连接器</strong> 的新型显示连接方块。</p><p>它允许通过单一方块连接和管理多个信号源与目标，减少了在每个方块侧面布置显示连接器的需求，使复杂布局更整洁，维护更简便。</p>",
